       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Seriously, this is such a huge crater. This whole location is massive.",
         "transl": "Was für ein riesiger Krater. Der ganze Ort ist riesig."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.luke",
         "expression": "WONDERING"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "You know... when I saw Homestedt for the first time, I was really surprised that Instatainment went so far for us.",
         "transl": "Weißt du... Als ich Heimstatt zum ersten Mal sah, war ich wirklich überrascht, wie sehr sich Instatainment für uns ins Zeug gelegt hat."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.luke",
         "expression": "WHISTLING"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "But looking at this dungeon in comparison... I can see how they'd manage to create a small village as a side project.",
