      "text": {
       "orig": "How's the tanking going, bro?",
       "transl": "Wie klappt's mit'm Tanken, Digga?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Tanked everything fine, barely a stretch!",
       "transl": "Alles weggetankt! Kaum 'n Kratzer abbekommen!"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Bro!\\. What are your thoughts on the new guardian boss?",
       "transl": "Digga!\\. Was hältst du vom neuen Wächter-Boss?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Much respect, bro!\\. What a shield!\\. Must have splendid defense!",
       "transl": "Hat meinen Respekt, Digga!\\. Was für ein Schild!\\. Muss richtig fett Verteidigung haben!"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Just what I thought, bro! That's a boss to my liking!",
       "transl": "Dacht' ich mir, Digga! So muss das!"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Twin tank bros approved!",
       "transl": "Jau! Genau richtig für die Tank-Brüder!"
      }
